DISCUS Macros in this directory are:


1d.mac                 ! Simulates a 1d crystal and calculates the Fourier
1d_periodic.mac        ! Demonstrates periodic boundary conditions in 1d
2d.mac                 ! Simulates a 1d crystal and calculates the Fourier
2d_lots.mac            ! Demonstrates periodic boundary conditions in 2d
powder.mac             ! Calculates the powder pattern for a small crystal

fourier_2d.mac         ! The fourier part for the 2d calculation
fourier_2d_lots.mac    ! Demonstrates the use of lots for Fourier

output_fourier.mac     ! Support macro that writes the output
output_powder.mac      ! Support macro that writes the output

plot.mac               ! Writes a structure for plot with KUPLOT

KUPLOT Macros in this directory are:

k1d.mac                ! Plots the result of the 1d calculations
k1d_periodic.mac       ! Plots the effect of periodic boundary conditions
k2d.mac                ! Plots the result of the 2d calculations
k2d_lots.mac           ! Plots the use of lots in 2d calculations
kpowder.mac            ! Plots the powder output
kinte.mac
